s by key; get_object_details and get_object_relationships give physical evidence for object_keys copied from object_context; get_context_records gives Context records. get_source_context, get_gds_context and get_objects repeat inline data; do not call them.\n\nReaders return items with next_cursor/is_complete. Continue a chain with the returned cursor alone; a null selector (omit it instead), a selector added to a cursor, another reader's cursor, an unknown key or malformed arguments fail the whole run. Each call uses one of limited turns (default 50 per attempt) and each page stays in context; exhausting either fails the run. A reply without a reader call is your final answer, so finish every read first. A repair attempt starts without earlier reader results; re-read what fixes need.",
    "instruction_prompt": "<schemas>\n{{ schemas }}\n</schemas>\n\n<naming_instructions>\n{{ naming_instructions }}\n</naming_instructions>\n\n<audit_columns>\n{{ audit_columns }}\n</audit_columns>\n\n<technical_columns>\n{{ technical_columns }}\n</technical_columns>\n\n<dimensional_entity_scd_type>\n{{ dimensional_entity_scd_type }}\n</dimensional_entity_scd_type>\n\n<dimensional_fact_types>\n{{ dimensional_fact_types }}\n</dimensional_fact_types>\n\n<model_summary>\n{{ model_summary }}\n</model_summary>\n\n<conformance_candidates>\n{{ conformance_candidates }}\n</conformance_candidates>\n\n<type_conflicts>\n{{ type_conflicts }}\n</type_conflicts>\n\n<name_variants>\n{{ name_variants }}\n</name_variants>\n\n<entity_details>\n{{ entity_details }}\n</entity_details>\n\n## Task\n\nOptimize the whole Dimensional model from inline and reader evidence with the ordered design in the system message.\nBefore returning, confirm: every change answers a finding or clear evidence; every merge keeps one Dimension, moves its Logical sources, business Attributes and edges and retires the other; every relationship names business endpoints that exist; no locked record changes; no business Attribute takes a reserved or generated name.",
